<div class="dashboard-subtitle">A control room for notes, tasks, ideas, and the vault graph.</div>
</div>

[[Check Later/Things to do|Inbox]] · [[Mero's Diaries 📓/Daily Journal/Daily Journal - 27_11_2024|Journal]] · [[1_ Projects Stack/Agent 01_ Suzy Mero Steele 😈/Mero Protocol V25 - The Sovereign Actuator & The Searchlight|Projects]] · [[3_ Resources Stack/A.I./A.I Tools|AI tools]] · [[4_ Archives/Brechó_|Archives]]

> [!note]+ Open loops
> ```dataview
> TASK
> FROM ""
> WHERE !completed
> SORT file.mtime DESC
> LIMIT 12
> ```

> [!info]+ Project pulse
> ```dataview
> LIST
> FROM "1_ Projects Stack"
> SORT file.mtime DESC
> LIMIT 8
> ```

> [!tip]+ Graph pulse
> ```dataviewjs
> const pages = dv.pages()
>   .where(p => !p.file.path.startsWith('.obsidian')
>     && !p.file.path.startsWith('.trash')
>     && !p.file.path.startsWith('Attachments/')
>     && p.file.path !== dv.current().file.path
>     && !p.file.path.includes('/Attachments/'));
> const universe = pages.length;
> const linked = pages.where(p => p.file.inlinks.length > 0).length;
> const top = pages
>   .sort(p => p.file.inlinks.length, 'desc')
>   .slice(0, 5);
> dv.el('div', `Vault notes: ${universe} • Connected: ${linked} • Top 5 nodes`, { cls: 'dashboard-graph-summary' });
> dv.table(['Note', 'Links'], top.map(p => [p.file.link, p.file.inlinks.length]));
> ```

> [!example]+ Random idea
> ```dataviewjs
> const pages = dv.pages()
>   .where(p => !p.file.path.startsWith('.obsidian')
>     && !p.file.path.startsWith('.trash')
>     && !p.file.path.startsWith('Attachments/')
>     && p.file.path !== dv.current().file.path
>     && !p.file.path.includes('/Attachments/'));
> if (!pages.length) {
>   dv.paragraph('No ideas yet.');
> } else {
>   const sample = pages[Math.floor(Math.random() * pages.length)];
>   dv.paragraph(sample.file.link);
>   dv.paragraph(`Source: ${sample.file.path}`);
> }
> ```

> [!success]+ Knowledge hubs
